# ---- secrets: keys, tokens, env files, local machine settings (never commit)
*key*
!**/keys.md
*token*
*.env
.env*
*.pem
*.p12
infra/local_settings.json
# keep the example settings and code files that only mention keys in their names out of the *key* rule
!infra/local_settings.example.json
# the playbook name contains "token" (cost per token); it is a document, not a secret
!docs/PLAYBOOK_cost_per_token_gemma4_glm53flash.md

